    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51669" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knot</i>: metaph.,<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λύειν λόγου</span> (dub.l.) to solve a
